# =============================================================================
# FAR-Lab Environment Variables (TEMPLATE ONLY — NO REAL SECRETS)
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# WARNING: .env is gitignored. Never commit .env or any file containing real
#          API keys, tokens, or passwords. See SECURITY.md for full policy.
# =============================================================================

# --- Competition Profile: Aliyun Bailian / DashScope ---
# Required only for competition_aliyun_qwen adapter.
# Core gates (offline replay) run WITHOUT this key.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: Override default endpoints ---
# COMPETITION_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL=

# --- Optional: Server configuration ---
# PORT=3000
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# NODE_ENV=development

# --- Optional: Node 24 compile cache ---
# Node ≥24 writes V8 compile cache to `<cwd>/0/` on every run when NODE_COMPILE_CACHE is
# unset (or set to a RELATIVE path like "0" — relative paths resolve against cwd and leak
# a `0/` directory into the repo; gitignored but physically recreated each run).
# Correct options:
#   1. Redirect to a repo-EXTERNAL absolute path (recommended):
#      NODE_COMPILE_CACHE=C:/Users/<you>/AppData/Local/Temp/node-compile-cache
#   2. Or fully disable the cache:
#      NODE_DISABLE_COMPILE_CACHE=1
# NOTE: setting NODE_COMPILE_CACHE=0 does NOT disable it — it points the cache at ./0.
# Machine-wide fix: [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable("NODE_COMPILE_CACHE", "<abs-path>", "User")
